msgid ""
"``form_params`` cannot be used with the `multipart`_ option. You will "
"need to use one or the other. Use ``form_params`` for ``application/x"
"-www-form-urlencoded`` request, and ``multipart`` for ``multipart/form-"
"data`` requests."
msgstr ""

